Description: file sessions store for aiohttp.web
 The library provides file sessions store for aiohttp.web.
 .
 This package provides support for storing aiohttp sessions in files,
 which can be useful for applications that need persistent session
 storage without requiring a database or memory store.
 .
 Features:
  * File-based session storage
  * Compatible with aiohttp.web
  * Asynchronous file operations using aiofiles
  * Configurable session parameters (cookie name, domain, max age, etc.)
